  "releaseNotes": "# [v0.3.0-pre-4390395d](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/compare/6097b279d3d5549d5971c4a0cb25a767b89a1362...4390395d3e6a0cb510672aceaafdebb707ac5a0f) (2026-01-16)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **parameter:** remove invalid $ character in value ([acf9527](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/acf9527f118e28f6ac823dfb9d259cbe40f8ef92))\n* **response:** use the proper serializer ([01ac4be](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/01ac4be034e3e9f7520a7a6453d67c318ee5f3c1))\n* **response:** write response header specifications using the correct format ([7f431e7](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/7f431e77148a712c7baf06d8d2facb289f918538))\n* **validation:** push schema location explicitly to set proper location on primitive json types ([ea938cd](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/ea938cd9e74668b14057505d9129cd59d0a9270f))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **openapi:** add v3 visitors ([788cb0e](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/788cb0e61c37c25c1dd9cff6104677bf76a5160e))\n* **parameter:** support parameter value parsing for openapi 3.0 and 3.1 ([e220edb](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/e220edb2f04ee652db328b748cde238e7d694c78))",
